## Start of every agent turn

1. Read `PROGRESS` (current slice / blockers).
2. Read the next open item in `SLICE_BACKLOG` (or the slice the user named).
3. Skim the relevant section of `PLAN` / `PLAN_GAP` / `ARCHITECTURE.md`.
4. State a **Slice Plan** before editing:

```text
SLICE: <id> — <title>
GOAL: <one sentence>
TARGET_PATHS: <explicit list>
ACCEPTANCE:
  - <observable criterion>
  - <observable criterion>
TESTS: <test paths to add/update>
OUT OF SCOPE: <what this slice will not do>
```

5. Implement **only** that slice. Stop when DoD is met. No drive-by features.

