## Anti-patterns (reject)

- Whole-repo rewrites or “foundation” PRs with no tested increment
- Stubs / `NotImplementedError`-equivalents / fake OK shipped as done
- Silent scope cuts or inventing alternate product vision
- Drive-by refactors mixed into feature slices (split them)
- Implementing later phases before listed prerequisites in `SLICE_BACKLOG`
- Repo-wide `eslint --fix` that destroys intentional facade re-exports
- Duplicating the full unit suite in multiple CI steps (one authoritative Vitest run)
- Bulk AI restating comments or redundant module JSDoc that only narrates code
- Mocking network / DOM **only** to inflate coverage on adapters omitted from the unit
  denominator — extend **integration / Playwright** instead
- Hollow `index.ts` barrels that re-export nothing real
- Editing the Victory Bowling app monorepo to “make the assistant compile” without an ADR
  (consume VB as a **pack/host adapter**, or copy fixtures — don’t create cycles)
- Adding Whisper, Deepgram, or server STT “just for Firefox”
- LLM call in the default intent path without an ADR
- Clicking buttons by visible label in production coach code instead of `data-guide-id`
- Shipping a permanent checklist side panel when the product is chat + palette

