## Local CI gate (run before every PR / slice DoD)

Provide `scripts/ci/ci_check.sh` and `scripts/ci/ci_check.ps1` (or `ci_check.mjs`) that
mirror GitHub Actions. Guard drift with `tests/unit/ci-check-parity.test.ts`.

### Minimum blocking gate

```bash
pnpm lint
pnpm typecheck
pnpm test -- --coverage
# coverage floors enforced in vitest config / ci script (global ≥75%, core ≥85%)
pnpm exec vitest run packs/**/corpus*.ts packages/core   # corpus if separate
```

### Recommended maturity gates (add as the repo grows)

| Gate | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Fast PR gate | ESLint + typecheck + unit (no Playwright) |
| Import graph / boundary | `apps` ↛ sideways into packs internals; `core` ↛ `react` |
| Module size | All `packages/**/*.ts` ≤ **1000** lines |
| LOC budget | Cap total non-blank lines; ratchet baseline down on refactors |
| Composite / corpus size | Corpus runners thin; cases in dedicated corpus modules |
| Pack JSON Schema | Every pack validates before codegen |
| Facade export tests | Package `index.ts` public API stays intentional |
| Playwright `@guide-nlu` | Coach smoke when Host / FAB / palette / anchors change |
| Complexity gate | Nesting/branch limits on dispatch hot paths |

**Do not** re-run the full unit suite inside a matrix “streams” job if the unit job already
owns coverage — one authoritative Vitest run.

Optional flags:

```bash
./scripts/ci/ci_check.sh --with-e2e
./scripts/ci/ci_check.sh --with-demo-host
./scripts/ci/ci_check.sh --skip-playwright
```

