## Commit message conventions

| Prefix | When |
|--------|------|
| `feat(scope):` | New behavior |
| `fix(scope):` | Bug fix |
| `test:` | Test-only coverage (often follows feat in same PR) |
| `refactor(scope):` | Behavior-preserving restructure |
| `chore:` | CI, deps, baselines, non-behavior metadata |
| `docs:` | ADRs, ARCHITECTURE, operator docs |

Body: **why** and observable outcome, not a file list. One slice ≈ one commit when possible.
Do not create commits unless the user asks.

