## Fresh repo bootstrap

1. Copy this file to `.cursor/rules/typescript-slice-master.mdc` (`alwaysApply: true`)
   **or** keep under `assistant/` and point the assistant repo agents at it.
2. Scaffold: root `package.json` + pnpm workspace, `packages/core`, `tests` or colocated
   tests, `scripts/ci/ci_check.*`, `docs/PROGRESS.md`, `docs/SLICE_BACKLOG.md`,
   `docs/PLAN.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`.
3. First slice: **`boot-001`** — `packages/core` importable + one real pure function +
   one Vitest + lint/typecheck/test wired in CI script.
4. Second slice: **`boot-002`** — import graph test stub + module size test stub.
5. Third slice: **`boot-003`** — pack JSON Schema stub + one `_template` pack that
   validates.
6. Fourth slice: **`boot-004`** — `PROGRESS` / `SLICE_BACKLOG` / ADR-000 filled for the
   assistant north star (workflow map + control map + intent layer + runtime coach).

Keep `python-slice-master.mdc` only as a **cross-language OS reference** — do not run a
Python toolchain in this repo unless an ADR adds a Python codegen sidecar.

