## Communication

- Be concise. Lead with **slice id completed** and **commands to run**  
  (`pnpm test …`, `pnpm exec playwright test …`, `./scripts/ci/ci_check.sh`).
- Blockers → PROGRESS with explicit “blocked by” and next unblocked id.
- Product/architecture decisions → ADR when chosen; do not ask permission to follow this
  constitution — **do** ask when PLAN open decisions must be chosen.
- User-facing behavior → update shipped `docs/`, not only planning docs.
- When blocked on missing prerequisites, record it and move to the next unblocked slice —
  do not idle inventing scope.

