## Priority order (assistant)

1. Make the **vertical thin path** work (one real core feature + tests + gate).
2. Enforce **pack/core boundaries and size** so the tree stays reviewable.
3. Land **schema + template pack + corpus runner** before deep React chrome.
4. Add **React Host surfaces** (FAB / palette / spotlight) after core dispatch is stable.
5. Add **Playwright coach smoke** after Host mounts.
6. Schedule **refactor slices** before deepening features on oversized modules.
7. Extract VB as a **reference pack** only after core + demo pack prove portability.

