## Quick reference card

```text
READ:     PROGRESS → SLICE_BACKLOG → PLAN section
PLAN:     emit Slice Plan (paths, acceptance, tests, out-of-scope)
BUDGET:   ≤3 files / ≤120 LOC (hotfix ≤1 / ≤80)
BUILD:    real behavior only — no stubs
TEST:     Vitest behavior names; corpus for intents; Playwright typed coach smoke
GATE:     eslint + tsc + vitest(+cov) + schema/import/size + e2e when required
RECORD:   PROGRESS (done / notes / next)
REFACTOR: every 4–6 slices or ~400 LOC soft cap
VOICE:    Web Speech; Chrome/Edge/Safari; Firefox type-only; NO Whisper
WRITES:   coach + navigate + prefill only — no silent API creates
ANCHORS:  data-guide-id only
BLOCKED:  write PROGRESS → next unblocked slice
```
